#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "How to use a virtual private endpoint to privately connect to IBM Quantum Platform."
msgstr "Come usare un endpoint privato virtuale per connetterti privatamente a IBM Quantum Platform."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use virtual private endpoints for VPC to privately connect to IBM Quantum Platform"
msgstr "Usa gli endpoint privati virtuali per VPC per connetterti privatamente a IBM Quantum Platform"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use virtual private endpoints for VPC to privately connect to IBM Quantum Platform {#use-virtual-private-endpoints-for-vpc-to-privately-connect-to-ibm-quantum-platform}"
msgstr "Usa gli endpoint privati virtuali per VPC per connetterti privatamente a IBM Quantum Platform {#use-virtual-private-endpoints-for-vpc-to-privately-connect-to-ibm-quantum-platform}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use Virtual Private Endpoints (VPE) for [Virtual Private Cloud (VPC)](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc) to connect to IBM Quantum&reg; from your VPC network. The connection uses the IP address that you specify, allocated from a subnet within your VPC.\n"
msgstr "Usa i Virtual Private Endpoints (VPE) per [Virtual Private Cloud (VPC)](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc) per connetterti a IBM Quantum&reg; dalla tua rete VPC. La connessione usa l'indirizzo IP che specifichi tu, allocato da una sottorete all'interno del tuo VPC.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "VPEs are virtual IP interfaces that are bound to an endpoint gateway created on a per-service basis. The endpoint gateway is a virtualized function that scales horizontally, is redundant and highly available, and spans all availability zones of your VPC. Endpoint gateways enable communications from virtual server instances within your VPC and IBM Cloud&reg; service on the private backbone. VPE for VPC lets you control all private addressing within your cloud. For more information, see [About virtual private endpoint gateways](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-about-vpe).\n"
msgstr "I VPE sono interfacce IP virtuali associate a un endpoint gateway creato su base per-servizio. L'endpoint gateway è una funzione virtualizzata che scala orizzontalmente, è ridondante e ad alta disponibilità, e copre tutte le zone di disponibilità del tuo VPC. Gli endpoint gateway abilitano le comunicazioni dalle istanze di server virtuali all'interno del tuo VPC e il servizio IBM Cloud&reg; sul backbone privato. VPE per VPC ti permette di controllare tutto l'indirizzamento privato all'interno del tuo cloud. Per maggiori informazioni, consulta [Informazioni sugli endpoint gateway privati virtuali](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-about-vpe).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Regardless of whether you use VPEs, all internal communication within IBM Quantum Platform's network always uses private connections rather than the public internet.\n"
msgstr "Indipendentemente dal fatto che tu usi i VPE, tutte le comunicazioni interne all'interno della rete di IBM Quantum Platform usano sempre connessioni private anziché la rete internet pubblica.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Whether your connection to IBM Quantum Platform itself is public or private depends on whether you use a VPE. Connecting through the public endpoints transmits all request and response data over the public internet. Connecting through a VPE keeps that traffic on the private network instead.\n"
msgstr "Il fatto che la tua connessione a IBM Quantum Platform stessa sia pubblica o privata dipende dal fatto che tu usi o meno un VPE. Connettersi tramite gli endpoint pubblici trasmette tutti i dati di richiesta e risposta sulla rete internet pubblica. Connettersi tramite un VPE mantiene invece quel traffico sulla rete privata.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "VPEs are supported only for the IBM Quantum Platform API and SDK, as described in the following sections. The IBM Quantum Platform website does not support VPEs and can only be accessed over the public network.\n"
msgstr "I VPE sono supportati solo per l'API e l'SDK di IBM Quantum Platform, come descritto nelle sezioni seguenti. Il sito web di IBM Quantum Platform non supporta i VPE e può essere accessibile solo tramite la rete pubblica.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Before you begin {#before-you-begin}"
msgstr "Prima di iniziare {#before-you-begin}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Before you target a VPE for IBM Quantum Platform, complete the following steps:\n"
msgstr "Prima di puntare un VPE a IBM Quantum Platform, completa i seguenti passaggi:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Create a Virtual Private Cloud](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-getting-started).\n"
msgstr "[Crea un Virtual Private Cloud](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-getting-started).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Plan for the network topology](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-vpe-planning-considerations) to connect to VPEs.\n"
msgstr "[Pianifica la topologia di rete](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-vpe-planning-considerations) per connetterti ai VPE.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Set access controls](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-configure-acls-sgs-endpoint-gateways) for your VPE.\n"
msgstr "[Imposta i controlli di accesso](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-configure-acls-sgs-endpoint-gateways) per il tuo VPE.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Understand the [service restrictions](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-limitations).\n"
msgstr "Comprendi le [restrizioni del servizio](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-limitations).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Understand how to [view VPE details](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-vpe-viewing-details-of-an-endpoint-gateway).\n"
msgstr "Scopri come [visualizzare i dettagli del VPE](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-vpe-viewing-details-of-an-endpoint-gateway).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set up a VPE for IBM Quantum Platform {#set-up-a-vpe-for-ibm-quantum-platform}"
msgstr "Configura un VPE per IBM Quantum Platform {#set-up-a-vpe-for-ibm-quantum-platform}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "There are several ways to create a VPE gateway. If you use the [CLI](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-vpc-reference&interface=cli#vpe-clis) or [API](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/vpc/latest#create-endpoint-gateway), you must specify the [Cloud Resource Name (CRN)](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-crn) of the region in which you want connect to IBM Quantum Platform. Review the following table for the available regions and CRNs.\n"
msgstr "Ci sono diversi modi per creare un gateway VPE. Se usi la [CLI](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-vpc-reference&interface=cli#vpe-clis) o l'[API](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/vpc/latest#create-endpoint-gateway), devi specificare il [Cloud Resource Name (CRN)](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-crn) della regione in cui vuoi connetterti a IBM Quantum Platform. Consulta la tabella seguente per le regioni e i CRN disponibili.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Region | Plans   | Fully Qualified Domain Name (FQDN) | Cloud Resource Name (CRN) |\n"
"|-----------------|-----------------|-----------------|-----------------|\n"
"| `us-east` | `Standard` | `private.us-east.quantum.cloud.ibm.com` | `crn:v1:bluemix:public:quantum-computing:us-east:::endpoint:private.us-east.quantum.cloud.ibm.com` |\n"
"| `eu-de` | `Standard` | `private.eu-de.quantum.cloud.ibm.com` | `crn:v1:bluemix:public:quantum-computing:eu-de:::endpoint:private.eu-de.quantum.cloud.ibm.com` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Regione | Piani   | Fully Qualified Domain Name (FQDN) | Cloud Resource Name (CRN) |\n"
"|-----------------|-----------------|-----------------|-----------------|\n"
"| `us-east` | `Standard` | `private.us-east.quantum.cloud.ibm.com` | `crn:v1:bluemix:public:quantum-computing:us-east:::endpoint:private.us-east.quantum.cloud.ibm.com` |\n"
"| `eu-de` | `Standard` | `private.eu-de.quantum.cloud.ibm.com` | `crn:v1:bluemix:public:quantum-computing:eu-de:::endpoint:private.eu-de.quantum.cloud.ibm.com` |\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configuring an endpoint gateway {#configuring-an-endpoint-gateway}"
msgstr "Configurazione di un endpoint gateway {#configuring-an-endpoint-gateway}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To configure a VPE gateway, follow these steps:\n"
msgstr "Per configurare un gateway VPE, segui questi passaggi:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "List the available services, including IBM Cloud infrastructure services available (by default) for all VPC users.\n"
msgstr "Elenca i servizi disponibili, inclusi i servizi di infrastruttura IBM Cloud disponibili (per impostazione predefinita) per tutti gli utenti VPC.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Create an endpoint gateway](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-ordering-endpoint-gateway) for IBM Quantum Platform that you want to be privately available to the VPC.\n"
msgstr "[Crea un endpoint gateway](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-ordering-endpoint-gateway) per IBM Quantum Platform che vuoi rendere accessibile privatamente al VPC.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Bind a reserved IP address](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-bind-unbind-reserved-ip) to the endpoint gateway.\n"
msgstr "[Associa un indirizzo IP riservato](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-bind-unbind-reserved-ip) all'endpoint gateway.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[View the created VPE gateways](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-vpe-viewing-details-of-an-endpoint-gateway) associated with IBM Quantum Platform.\n"
msgstr "[Visualizza i gateway VPE creati](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-vpe-viewing-details-of-an-endpoint-gateway) associati a IBM Quantum Platform.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Now your virtual server instances in the VPC can access your IBM Quantum Platform instance privately.\n"
msgstr "Ora le tue istanze di server virtuali nel VPC possono accedere privatamente alla tua istanza di IBM Quantum Platform.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use your VPE for IBM Quantum Platform {#use-your-vpe-for-ibm-quantum-platform}"
msgstr "Usa il tuo VPE per IBM Quantum Platform {#use-your-vpe-for-ibm-quantum-platform}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "After you create an endpoint gateway for IBM Quantum Platform, follow these steps:\n"
msgstr "Dopo aver creato un endpoint gateway per IBM Quantum Platform, segui questi passaggi:\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the VPE with `qiskit-ibm-runtime` (Python SDK) {#use-the-vpe-with-qiskit-ibm-runtime-python-sdk}"
msgstr "Usa il VPE con `qiskit-ibm-runtime` (Python SDK) {#use-the-vpe-with-qiskit-ibm-runtime-python-sdk}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"VPE support requires `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.24.0 or later.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Il supporto VPE richiede `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.24.0 o versioni successive.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "When instantiating `QiskitRuntimeService`, specify `private_endpoint=True`.\n"
msgstr "Quando istanzi `QiskitRuntimeService`, specifica `private_endpoint=True`.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the VPE with the IBM Quantum API {#use-the-vpe-with-the-ibm-quantum-api}"
msgstr "Usa il VPE con l'API IBM Quantum {#use-the-vpe-with-the-ibm-quantum-api}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "After creating an endpoint gateway for IBM Quantum Platform, use the service endpoint's fully qualified domain name (FQDN) for the target region from [the prior table](#set-up-a-vpe-for-ibm-quantum-platform).\n"
msgstr "Dopo aver creato un endpoint gateway per IBM Quantum Platform, usa il nome di dominio completo (FQDN) dell'endpoint di servizio per la regione di destinazione dalla [tabella precedente](#set-up-a-vpe-for-ibm-quantum-platform).\n"
